  "metaDescription": "The Indonesia U-17 national team successfully advanced to the 2027 Asian Cup after finishing as the undefeated winners of their qualifying group.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Indonesia U-17 secured a spot in the 2027 Asian Cup final tournament after finishing at the top of their qualifying group.",
